# The interactive Guide: main menu -> Guide, then every page (Right arrow turns the page), with the "Try it" goal played on
# most of them. Squares are clicked by name (`clicksq <timeline> <half-turn> <square>`), see game-standard.ui.
# Layout: the main menu's Guide item (the fourth of Versus, Load game, Puzzles, Guide, Settings, Exit) is at (150, 430); Submit is the third button of the action row at (842, 90).
wait 20
click 150 430        # Guide
wait 40
capture guide-01-boards-and-time
clicksq 0 2 d2       # a pawn: its legal targets show
wait 40
capture guide-01-pawn-selected
clicksq 0 2 d4
wait 60
click 842 90         # Submit
wait 60
capture guide-01-turn-submitted

key RIGHT
wait 30
capture guide-02-moving-through-time
clicksq 0 2 b1       # the knight: dots on the older boards too
wait 40
capture guide-02-knight-selected
clicksq 0 0 b3       # back to T1w: a new timeline
wait 90
capture guide-02-new-timeline

key RIGHT
wait 30
capture guide-03-timeline-owners
clicksq 0 3 b8       # Black's knight on the last board of L0
wait 40
capture guide-03-knight-selected
clicksq 0 1 b6       # back to T1b of L0: L-1 appears below
wait 90
capture guide-03-black-timeline

key RIGHT
wait 30
capture guide-04-present-and-active
clicksq 0 4 a2
wait 40
clicksq 0 4 a3
wait 60
clicksq 1 4 a2
wait 40
clicksq 1 4 a3
wait 60
capture guide-04-both-moved
click 842 90         # Submit
wait 60
capture guide-04-turn-submitted

key RIGHT
wait 30
capture guide-05-four-axes
clicksq 1 2 d1       # the queen reaches along all four axes
wait 40
capture guide-05-queen-selected
clicksq 0 0 e2       # diagonally back in time and one timeline down: the first board of L0
wait 90
capture guide-05-changed-board

key RIGHT
wait 30
capture guide-06-pawns
clicksq 0 4 e4
wait 40
capture guide-06-pawn-selected
clicksq 0 4 d5       # the capture
wait 60
capture guide-06-captured

key RIGHT
wait 30
capture guide-07-check
clicksq 1 4 h3
wait 40
clicksq 1 4 h4
wait 60
clicksq 0 4 e1
wait 40
clicksq 0 4 d1
wait 60
capture guide-07-out-of-check
click 842 90         # Submit
wait 60
capture guide-07-turn-submitted

key RIGHT
wait 30
capture guide-08-checkmate
clicksq 0 0 a1
wait 40
clicksq 0 0 a8
wait 60
click 842 90         # Submit
wait 120
capture guide-08-mate

key RIGHT
wait 30
capture guide-09-special-moves
clicksq 0 4 e1       # castling targets g1 and c1
wait 40
capture guide-09-king-selected
clicksq 0 4 e1       # deselect
wait 20
clicksq 0 4 b7
wait 40
clicksq 0 4 b8       # the promotion picker opens
wait 40
capture guide-09-promotion-picker
key N
wait 60
capture guide-09-promoted

key RIGHT
wait 30
capture guide-10-first-game
key LEFT
wait 30
capture guide-09-back-with-left-arrow
